### 1.2 Documentation knowledge adopted

From the upstream `AGENTS.md` / `README.md`:

- the "all game API calls must return to the main thread" rule with its
  `Campaign.Current != null` / `Mission.Current != null` precondition checks;
- the "actions and waiters come in pairs; never `sleep`" convention;
- the Gauntlet `click_widget` XAML-binding pitfall;
- the "never enter 3D mission scenes" hard constraint.

Recorded in `docs/lessons-from-bannerlord-gabs.md`, `docs/thread-model-comparison.md`,
`docs/l2-api-drift-1.4.8.md`, `docs/gabp-naming.md`.

### 1.3 Approach explicitly NOT adopted

Upstream's versioned assembly names, runtime tool registration + static proxy tools,
required `Bannerlord.Harmony` / `ButterLib` / `MCM` dependencies, and the
`Beta_Debug` / `Stable_Debug` + NuGet build system were **evaluated and not adopted**
(see `docs/lessons-from-bannerlord-gabs.md` §三). No upstream dependency was introduced.

